  textC: {fileID: 1583342774}
  NameC: {fileID: 1099673402}
  names:
  - Handler
  - You
  - Handler
  lines:
  - "This is your first mission on the field, so listen closely! I\u2019m going to
    describe your target to you, and you need to find them with your scope. Be VERY
    sure of your target before you shoot."
  - "Descriptions? Aren\u2019t you blind\u2026?"
  - "I\u2019m blind to sight, not your remarks, you stupid apprentice. I\u2019ll
    have you know I was an elite assassin in my heyday! Anyways, I have the details
    from our informants, and they\u2019re very reliable. I think. Let\u2019s see\u2026"
  textSpeed: 0.1
  yes: {fileID: 153020402}
  panel: {fileID: 153020402}
  Directions: 0
